  <p id="c-nanshi-025-yuan-xizu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">伯父豫州刺史<persName id="c-nanshi-025-yuan-xizu:p001:m0006" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-025-yuan-xizu:p001:m0009" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AAC">襲祖</persName>為淮陽太守，孝武以事徙之嶺南，<persName id="c-nanshi-025-yuan-xizu:p001:m0026" ref="bdx_txf_e62_AA">護之</persName>不食而死。</p>
